<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Philips figures.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Philips figures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Earnings estimates for Philips Electronics NV were raised at Goldman Sachs, the investest bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Goldman raised its 1997 earnings per share estimate by 38 percent to 6.85 guilders and its 1998 forecast by 16 percent to 9.62 guilders and repeated a &quot;market outperformer&quot; rating on the stock.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
